sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Creator
  participant UI as Web app
  participant API as API service
  participant Q as Job queue
  participant W as Worker
  participant LLM as LLM
  participant T as TTS
  participant I as Image / video
  participant S as Storage

  C->>UI: choose topic
  UI->>API: POST /projects
  API->>API: check plan allowance
  API-->>UI: 402 if exhausted
  API->>Q: enqueue SCRIPT
  Q->>W: lease SCRIPT
  W->>LLM: script + art direction + scenes
  LLM-->>W: structured JSON
  W->>API: script ready
  API-->>UI: notify

  Note over C,UI: Human checkpoint 1
  C->>UI: edit hook, add commentary
  UI->>API: approve script
  API->>Q: enqueue MEDIA

  Q->>W: lease MEDIA
  W->>T: narration
  T-->>W: audio + word timings
  par scenes in parallel
    W->>I: still, locked seed
    I-->>W: image
  and
    W->>I: animate hero scenes
    I-->>W: clips
  end
  W->>W: assemble, burn captions, encode
  W->>S: put 1080p renders
  W->>LLM: title, description, tags
  LLM-->>W: metadata
  W->>API: complete + cost
  API-->>UI: ready for review

  Note over C,UI: Human checkpoint 2
  C->>UI: pick title and thumbnail
